Honey 2 is a 2011 American dance film and a sequel to the 2003 film Honey,
directed by Bille Woodruff, who directed the original film.

11
01:15:37,500 --> 01:15:43,500
It stars Kat Graham, Randy Wayne, Seychelle Gabriel and Lonette McKee, reprising her
role as Connie Daniels, the mother of Honey Daniels from the first film.

12
01:22:30,000 --> 01:22:36,000
The film was released to cinemas in United Kingdom on June 10, 2011, and
straight-to-video in the United States on February 21, 2012, on DVD and Blu-ray.

13
01:29:22,500 --> 01:29:28,500
